" data-tatoeba-id=\"75754\"><ruby>彼女<rp>(</rp><rt>かのじょ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はラッセルスクエア５６<ruby>番地<rp>(</rp><rt>ばんち</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>住<rp>(</rp><rt>す</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>んでいた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">She lived at 56 Russell Square.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">バンド</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">乐队；音乐团体；带；皮带；表带；腰带；皮带；（频率）频段；波段</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"197756\">バンドの<ruby>演奏<rp>(</rp><rt>えんそう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>何時<rp>(</rp><rt>なんじ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>始<rp>(</rp><rt>はじ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>まりますか。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">What time will the band start playing?</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">万能</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ばんのう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">万能；多用途；通用；全能；万能；全知全能；多面手</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"144266\"><ruby>人間<rp>(</rp><rt>にんげん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>神<rp>(</rp><rt>かみ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ほど<ruby>万能<rp>(</rp><rt>ばんのう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ではない。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">Man is not as almighty as God.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">番目</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ばんめ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"v-m\">第…个；歌舞伎演出的幕；歌舞伎的场次</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"235255\">３<ruby>番目<rp>(</rp><rt>ばんめ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>星<rp>(</rp><rt>ほし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はある<ruby>王様<rp>(</rp><rt>おうさま</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>物<rp>(</rp><rt>もの</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>でした。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">The third star belonged to a certain king.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">バー</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">酒吧；酒馆；小酒馆；酒廊；酒吧；柜台（出售食物和饮料的场所）；横杆（跳高或撑竿跳中）；横梁（足球、橄榄球等中）；把杆（芭蕾舞）</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"123088\"><ruby>二人<rp>(</rp><rt>ふたり</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>男<rp>(</rp><rt>おとこ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はバーで<ruby>飲<rp>(</rp><rt>の</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>んでいた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">The two men were drinking in a bar.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">パイプ</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">管；管子；导管；烟斗；烟嘴；烟管；中间人；中介；调解人；人脉关系；沟通渠道</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"111317\"><ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はパイプをくわえて<ruby>話<rp>(</rp><rt>はな</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>した。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">He spoke with a pipe in his mouth.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">パイロット</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">飞行员；驾驶员</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"111316\"><ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はパイロットになる<ruby>決意<rp>(</rp><rt>けつい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>をした。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">He made up his mind to be a pilot.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">パジャマ</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">睡衣；宽松睡裤套装</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"223371\">このパジャマはよく<ruby>汗<rp>(</rp><rt>あせ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>吸収<rp>(</rp><rt>きゅうしゅう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>します。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">These pajamas absorb sweat well.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">パス</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">及格；通过（考试、检查等）；通行证；入场券；车票；（体育）传球；（轮到自己时）跳过；让过本轮；不出；（对某事）放过；婉拒；（围棋）虚手；停一手（已无有益着手时）</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">パスポート</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">护照</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"198077\">パスポートを<ruby>拝見<rp>(</rp><rt>はいけん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>できますか。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">May I see your passport, please?</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">パソコン</span><span class=\"v-r