/rp></ruby>て<ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>逃<rp>(</rp><rt>に</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>げた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">He ran away at the sight of a police patrol.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">パン</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../n5/vocab/\">N5</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">面包；（甜）糕点；生活必需品；衣食来源</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">パンク</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">轮胎爆裂；扁胎；爆胎；爆裂；溢出；堵塞（如电话线路）；达到临界点；崩溃；故障；破产</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">パンツ</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">内裤；短裤；三角裤；裤子（尤指女裤）；马裤；骑马裤；游泳裤</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"197760\">パンツとブラジャー<ruby>以外<rp>(</rp><rt>いがい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>全部<rp>(</rp><rt>ぜんぶ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>脱<rp>(</rp><rt>ぬ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>いでください。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">Please take off all your clothes except your underpants and bra.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">パーセント</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">